# MT Dayshift global colour scheme — the light counterpart of MT Nightshift,
# derived from Breeze (KDE Breeze, plasma-breeze-common 6.8.2).
# Cool carbon-whites mirror the Nightshift OLED tones; the restrained Breeze-blue
# accents are shared with the dark scheme. Semantic colours are the dark set
# re-tuned darker for light surfaces: every Foreground* role clears 4.66:1 on
# both backgrounds of its group (checked by tools/theme-audit/check-theme.py).
# Values are documented in design.md; keep this file and themes/mt-dayshift/colors in sync.
